flowchart TD
    MSG[Telegram message] --> STATE{awaiting a button answer?}
    STATE -->|yes| BTN[custom hours / delay / issue key]
    STATE -->|no| CLS[classify intent · gpt-4.1-nano · temp 0]

    MEM[(ConversationMemory · last 6 turns)] -.->|history| CLS
    CLS --> INTENT{intent}

    INTENT -->|chitchat| HELP[help text]
    INTENT -->|question| AGENT
    INTENT -->|worklog| PARSE[parse report · gpt-4o-mini]

    subgraph LG[LangGraph agent · create_agent · 90s timeout]
        AGENT[agent node · gpt-4o-mini] --> DECIDE{tool call?}
        DECIDE -->|yes| TOOLS[tool node]
        TOOLS --> AGENT
        DECIDE -->|no| DONE[final answer]
    end

    subgraph PERSONAL[scoped to the caller · assignee = caller]
        T1[task_details]
        T2[list_tasks]
        T3[count_tasks]
        T4[logged_hours]
        T5[whoami]
        T6[board_link]
        T7[my_briefing]
    end

    subgraph PROJECT[scoped to a project · no assignee filter]
        T8[sprint_epics]
        T9[sprint_board · unit / person / type / topic]
    end

    TOOLS --- PERSONAL
    TOOLS --- PROJECT

    CTX[[AssistantContext · identity bound in Python]] -.->|may_read| PERSONAL
    CTX -.->|may_read_others OR own work in project| PROJECT

    T9 -.->|unit| UNITS[(user_components · who does design)]
    T9 -.->|topic| TRANK[rank_texts · embedding · floor 0.38]
    T8 -.-> EPIC[roll stories up to Epic Link · cf_10100]

    T7 --> URG[urgent bugs · Highest/High · statusCategory != Done]
    T7 --> PURP[sprint purpose = its epics · no sprint goal is set]
    T7 --> OWN[own share · sprint first]
    URG --> MEDIA[[queue screenshots]]
    MEDIA --> SEND[download bytes · send_photo / send_video]

    T1 -.-> PARENT[parent Story then Epic · description + attachments]
    T2 -.-> CACHE[(task cache · per user · 120s)]
    CACHE --> JQL[Jira JQL · open sprint · unresolved]
    PARENT --> JIRA[(Jira)]
    JQL --> JIRA
    PROJECT --> JIRA

    PARSE --> NARROW[named project narrows candidates BEFORE the model sees them]
    NARROW --> SPLIT{splits found?}
    SPLIT -->|none| ASK[ask for hours and task]
    SPLIT -->|some| ORD[resolve ordinals + weekdays in Python]
    ORD --> RANK[rank each split · embedding · 512 dims]

    subgraph EMB[retrieval · text-embedding-3-small]
        RANK --> GATE{margin over runner-up >= 0.08?}
        GATE -->|no| NOMATCH[report no match · never guess]
        GATE -->|yes| SHORT[shortlist of 5]
        CACHE2[(vector cache · SHA-256 of text)] -.-> RANK
    end

    NOMATCH --> CONF
    SHORT --> CONF{all resolved?}
    CONF -->|no| PICK[ask which task · tappable options]
    PICK --> CONF
    CONF -->|yes| PREVIEW[confirm · hours · weekday · work type]
    PREVIEW -->|confirmed| WRITE[write worklog · started = worked_on]
    WRITE --> JIRA
    WRITE --> INVAL([invalidate cache])
    WRITE --> FOLLOW{digest session open?}
    FOLLOW -->|yes| REMAIN[ask only what the report did not cover]
    FOLLOW -->|no| ENDW[done]

    CRON[cron 09:00 · gated to one user] --> DIGEST
    subgraph DAILY[daily digest]
        DIGEST[build digest] --> UNBLOCK[blockers cleared · inwardIssue only]
        DIGEST --> REGRESS[regressed]
        DIGEST --> FLIGHT[in flight / waiting]
        DIGEST --> ONEQ[one open question]
    end
    ONEQ --> PARSE
    REMAIN --> QUEUE[per-task queue · max 8 · finish later]

    DONE --> MEM
    HELP --> MEM
    ASK --> MEM
